---
description: Use the installed document editor to prepare a minimal citation-grounded replacement.
args:
  goal: string
  snapshot: PacketSnapshot
  source: PacketSource
returns: PacketDocument | null
---
Use the installed policy.chooseRevision with goal, a document list containing the exact original candidate and the attested evidence document in that order, and research null. Return its selected path and text unchanged. Preserve the precise field labels, prefer the attached approved wording, and keep all unrelated text and layout. A stored preview is not a competing source grant.
